Study Looks at Political Bias in AI
​Researchers tested several popular AI models.
​They wanted to see how the AI answered questions about politics.
​The study found that many models gave similar answers on some political topics.
​The researchers said the answers often seemed to support more left-leaning ideas.
​The study also included Grok and other well-known AI models.
​Some experts agreed with the results.
​Others said testing AI on politics is difficult.
​They believe the results can change because of the questions people ask.
​AI companies say they want their systems to be fair and helpful.
​They continue to improve their models to reduce unwanted bias.
​The writer says people should think carefully about AI answers, especially on political topics, and compare information from different sources.
